4	line	Wizard Mizgog	Are you saying that you stole my beads all this time and I've been blaming these imps!?
4	line	Player	No, not at all! I just found them throughout my travels and presumed somebody would need them at some point.
4	line	Wizard Mizgog	Bah! Fine.
